WEBVTT

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:50.203
Shu and his team confronted
Nene in his castle,

00:01:50.233 --> 00:01:52.133
but found he was much more
powerful than they had imagined.

00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:55.026
As the teammates
get defeated one by one,

00:01:55.066 --> 00:01:56.426
in a moment of desperation,
Kluke discovered that she, too,

00:01:56.466 --> 00:01:57.726
had the power to
awaken a Shadow.

00:01:57.766 --> 00:02:01.766
Her Shadow, Phoenix, was able to
save the others from disaster.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.300
However...

00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:10.926
General Logi,
may I get right to it?

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.570
Sure, of course.

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:16.033
We're dominating the fight.

00:02:17.066 --> 00:02:18.266
It's just a matter of time.

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:22.403
The enemy's main force,
the Jibral Army, is now on the run.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.630
There might be pockets of resistance,
but they'll be defeated soon.

00:02:28.433 --> 00:02:32.233
Lord Nene is doing
a final check on

00:02:32.266 --> 00:02:34.866
the Flying Fortress Galleon
up in high altitude.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.430
From all reports,

00:02:36.466 --> 00:02:40.896
it appears that Zola and her group of
Shadow Wielders have been defeated.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.100
As if...

00:02:45.233 --> 00:02:46.573
Those guys are tough.

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:50.103
It's hard to believe that
they'd be defeated that easily.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:55.830
But, I guess it's just another testament
to the supremacy of Lord Nene's power.

00:02:57.066 --> 00:02:57.696
That's right.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.870
From the way things are,

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.900
Lord Nene will probably dominate
and rule this world in the near future.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.370
We need to hurry.

00:03:09.666 --> 00:03:10.666
Enemy located!

00:03:10.933 --> 00:03:13.803
At point 548.
The remainder of the Jibral Army!

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:16.503
Let's go!

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:24.566
A PATH TOWARDS HOPE

00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:39.503
Kluke...

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.700
She's not waking up.

00:03:42.066 --> 00:03:44.626
I wonder if she'll stay
like this forever, maro.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.800
No way!

00:03:47.966 --> 00:03:51.426
There's...just no way!

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:52.903
Sorry, maro.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:57.700
Here's a first-aid kit.

00:03:58.466 --> 00:04:01.266
It doesn't have much in it,
but it's better than nothing.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.470
Bouquet...

00:04:04.266 --> 00:04:04.926
Y-Yes.

00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:06.903
Shu, Jiro.

00:04:07.266 --> 00:04:09.326
You should also treat
your injuries as well.

00:04:11.366 --> 00:04:13.196
How can you be like that?

00:04:15.466 --> 00:04:17.496
Kluke isn't waking up!

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.200
How can you act like
there's nothing wrong?!

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.600
I know how you feel.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.570
But now is not the time
to talk about it.

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:30.626
Why does Kluke have to
go through all this?

00:04:32.766 --> 00:04:34.766
Why did you get Kluke involved!

00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:38.526
If I knew... I...

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.130
You wouldn't have fought?

00:04:44.366 --> 00:04:45.766
Cool down a bit.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:57.970
Kluke...

00:04:58.966 --> 00:04:59.966
Get it?

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:04.366
You are clumsy so don't
do anything reckless!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:09.700
Stop! If you get involved,
you're going to mess it up.

00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:12.166
Just leave it to me, alright?

00:05:13.066 --> 00:05:15.226
Wake up!

00:05:16.133 --> 00:05:18.103
You sleepyhead!

00:05:18.566 --> 00:05:19.226
Shu!

00:05:20.866 --> 00:05:21.526
Shu!

00:05:23.566 --> 00:05:24.226
Shu!

00:05:24.633 --> 00:05:25.633
Shu...

00:05:25.666 --> 00:05:26.666
Shu...

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.700
Shu...

00:05:27.733 --> 00:05:28.873
Shu...

00:05:36.833 --> 00:05:37.503
I...

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.300
I couldn't protect Kluke.

00:06:00.666 --> 00:06:01.666
Shu...

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:07.226
Jiro!

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:07.926
Shu!

00:06:14.866 --> 00:06:17.996
Here's another troubled one.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.900
Are you alright?

00:06:24.866 --> 00:06:26.066
What's gonna happen to Kluke?

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:28.800
I don't know.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.800
She summoned
her Shadow for the first time

00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:34.003
and used her special power
for the first time.

00:06:36.466 --> 00:06:40.296
But despite of that, she was able to
control it as well as she did.

00:06:49.433 --> 00:06:53.303
There is a possibility that
she might never wake up.

00:06:57.566 --> 00:06:59.126
Why did we lose?

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:01.670
Zola!

00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:05.303
I can't imagine you taking action
without thinking it through completely!

00:07:05.766 --> 00:07:07.866
To me,
it seems like you knew

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.200
that we didn't have the power
to go against Nene,

00:07:10.233 --> 00:07:12.403
but had us charge his castle,
anyway.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.230
I can't help but wonder if
you had another plan in mind.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.630
If that's the case, then we wouldn't
have faced such trouble.

00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:29.773
The enemy's in good shape,
the team's about to come apart,

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.030
and Kluke's in a coma.

00:07:35.733 --> 00:07:38.433
Do you think this is the result
of a well thought out plan?

00:07:40.533 --> 00:07:43.873
Is it true what he was saying?

00:07:44.566 --> 00:07:45.226
He?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.130
The father that Nene
was talking about...

00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:51.426
Are you the same as me?

00:07:52.166 --> 00:07:56.026
Unfortunately, I don't care
much about revenge or family.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.970
I got rid of my personal feelings
long time ago.

00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:03.696
Then why do you keep fighting?

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.930
I am not asking you to trust me.

00:08:09.833 --> 00:08:14.173
You should decide whether you
want to continue on this journey.

00:08:33.266 --> 00:08:34.996
What a great view.

00:08:35.233 --> 00:08:38.003
As long as we have
this Flying Fortress Galleon,

00:08:38.033 --> 00:08:40.633
it's only a matter of time
before the land below,

00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:43.566
and all the other lands of this world,
are brought under your control.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:45.770
Lord Nene!

00:08:47.033 --> 00:08:48.033
What?

00:08:48.433 --> 00:08:51.633
We have just completed a final check
of all the onboard systems.

00:08:52.133 --> 00:08:53.133
We await your command.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.970
I see. Good job.

00:08:56.233 --> 00:08:57.773
Good job, good job.

00:08:58.266 --> 00:09:01.026
So, which way shall we go?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:09.000
Southwest...which means...

00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:11.966
Jibral.

00:09:28.033 --> 00:09:30.003
Where did everyone go, maro?

00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:33.233
I wonder if everyone
is okay, maro.

00:09:33.933 --> 00:09:38.573
I think the one who is hurt
the most may be Zola.

00:09:38.933 --> 00:09:39.603
Maro?

00:09:40.333 --> 00:09:44.103
Even though she puts up a tough front,
she's truly kind underneath.

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:48.030
I will protect them,
if it's the last thing I do!

00:09:48.866 --> 00:09:50.696
I think she is hurt.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:55.000
What do you plan to do, maro?

00:09:56.533 --> 00:09:57.533
I don't know.

00:09:58.333 --> 00:10:01.333
I wonder what Shu
is planning to do.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.370
I...

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:16.870
Damn.

00:10:18.166 --> 00:10:19.396
How could this be!

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:35.930
Don't cry...on the battlefield.
Don't cry, Shu.

00:10:36.933 --> 00:10:37.933
I...

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.230
There you are.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:47.270
Jiro.

00:11:04.633 --> 00:11:09.103
Well? Are you done feeling
sorry for yourself?

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:09.970
What?!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.600
Do you feel better?
Taking it out on others?

00:11:14.633 --> 00:11:15.733
What do you mean?!

00:11:17.466 --> 00:11:18.566
Just as I said.

00:11:20.233 --> 00:11:21.303
You're pathetic.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:23.030
Acting as if you are the victim

00:11:23.066 --> 00:11:24.766
and ignoring the fact
that you were powerless.

00:11:26.166 --> 00:11:27.166
Shut up!

00:11:27.666 --> 00:11:30.726
Is someone gonna
save you if you whine?

00:11:31.833 --> 00:11:33.503
If you were fully committed,
maybeâ€”

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.630
Shut up!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.200
Ridiculous.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.730
That's what happens
when you attack impulsively,

00:11:42.766 --> 00:11:43.866
even though you are weak.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.100
What about you?

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:55.270
You talk the talk,
but you are no different!

00:11:56.466 --> 00:11:57.466
What?!

00:12:00.966 --> 00:12:02.666
You're giving me
all this lecture,

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.970
but you weren't
the least bit effective, either!

00:12:05.733 --> 00:12:10.103
If we had it together,
Kluke didn't have to end up like that!

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.930
I can't believe
you are still saying that!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.830
It's that kind of
half-hearted commitment thatâ€”

00:12:15.866 --> 00:12:17.526
Screw that!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.630
You lost too!

00:12:20.766 --> 00:12:22.596
We haven't lost yet!

00:12:22.666 --> 00:12:23.666
What?!

00:12:27.033 --> 00:12:28.433
I am still alive.

00:12:31.366 --> 00:12:33.996
As long as I am alive,
there is a chance.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.770
And I'll come at him again!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:39.970
No matter how many times it takes,
until Nene is defeated!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.200
I will have my revenge!

00:12:45.166 --> 00:12:46.166
You...

00:12:47.666 --> 00:12:48.866
Pull yourself together!

00:12:49.366 --> 00:12:52.296
I don't want someone
like you around me.

00:12:53.166 --> 00:12:54.396
It makes me want to throw up.

00:12:54.933 --> 00:12:55.933
I...

00:13:20.333 --> 00:13:21.003
They're...

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:22.300
Fake Shadows.

00:13:23.566 --> 00:13:24.926
Look!
There's someone over there!

00:13:36.066 --> 00:13:36.726
Oh, no!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:42.470
Zola...

00:13:44.933 --> 00:13:45.933
Stay hidden here.

00:14:00.566 --> 00:14:04.196
Before you deliver the information,
I'm gonna get rid of you.

00:14:24.766 --> 00:14:25.766
Are you okay?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.370
You're late!
Couldn't you have come sooner?!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:33.970
You!

00:14:34.333 --> 00:14:35.373
Legalas!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.930
That arrogant old man.

00:14:41.033 --> 00:14:43.473
Why are you here, maro?

00:14:43.633 --> 00:14:48.473
How dare you talk to me like that,
after I risked my life coming here!

00:14:48.933 --> 00:14:49.603
Maro.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.830
What do you mean?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.200
I was sent on assignment
from the King!

00:14:53.633 --> 00:14:58.803
I was told to relay the information
and I was looking all over for you guys.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.530
If it weren't for this,

00:15:00.566 --> 00:15:04.796
I would've been on the battlefield
by now defeating a thousand enemies!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.500
What is the information?

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.470
Oh yeah.

00:15:10.133 --> 00:15:15.373
I will tell you how much
I struggled to get here later.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.000
This is the follow-up report
on the incident

00:15:25.033 --> 00:15:26.633
that happened when
you were in Jibral.

00:15:27.033 --> 00:15:28.033
You mean...

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.830
The incident where
the Extra Seven got stolen?

00:15:31.466 --> 00:15:32.126
Yeah.

00:15:32.666 --> 00:15:36.066
Well then, I will explain it
clearly by using pictures.

00:15:36.166 --> 00:15:37.566
You don't have to!

00:15:38.233 --> 00:15:41.003
Gosh... And here I took
all this time to draw them!

00:15:41.633 --> 00:15:43.103
Just tell us already.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:44.270
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:45.900
Okay fine.

00:15:47.466 --> 00:15:49.466
According to our investigation,

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:52.870
the man who stole the last seven pages
of the Book of the Beginning,

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:57.400
known as the Extra Seven,
was a spy named Salinas.

00:15:57.933 --> 00:16:02.903
As you know, he was later
killed by an unknown assailant.

00:16:03.566 --> 00:16:06.466
With further investigation,

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:10.300
we've uncovered some clues
as to the identity of that assassin.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:17.670
The suspect seems to be a female,
in her 20s or 30s, with blue eyes.

00:16:18.433 --> 00:16:22.533
And she is likely to be wearing some
kind of perfume that smells like flowers.

00:16:24.066 --> 00:16:24.726
And then?

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.730
And then? This is all.

00:16:28.033 --> 00:16:31.403
You gave us a lot of nothing!

00:16:31.633 --> 00:16:34.503
You don't have a name or any idea
of what she looks like?!

00:16:34.966 --> 00:16:38.026
If we can find out stuff like that,
we wouldn't have any trouble on hand!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:41.500
This is the best we could
with the little clues we had.

00:16:41.633 --> 00:16:42.703
Don't be asking too much!

00:16:43.533 --> 00:16:49.233
There are many ladies with blue eyes.
It's the same with the perfume.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:53.430
She must be the new suspect
for the ghost incident.

00:16:53.733 --> 00:16:56.103
Yeah, who is this person?

00:16:56.866 --> 00:17:00.366
Now it is clear that
the Extra Seven was stolen.

00:17:02.833 --> 00:17:07.233
If it was stolen,
then someone must have it...

00:17:07.266 --> 00:17:09.926
someone that needs that document.

00:17:10.433 --> 00:17:11.433
What do you mean?

00:17:12.033 --> 00:17:15.403
I'm saying that it is now clear
what we have to do.

00:17:15.933 --> 00:17:16.603
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.830
I don't get it.

00:17:19.366 --> 00:17:20.996
Like I said before,

00:17:21.033 --> 00:17:25.633
the lost seven pages contain information
about the seven Shadow Wielders.

00:17:27.333 --> 00:17:29.503
This is only a guess,

00:17:29.533 --> 00:17:34.403
but I think it has information about
how to summon a Shadow.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:38.430
I think you know by now.

00:17:39.233 --> 00:17:41.573
We're not powerful enough
to win against Nene.

00:17:42.266 --> 00:17:47.596
I think it contains a way for us
to compensate for that lack of power.

00:17:50.766 --> 00:17:54.596
Wasn't that a book about
the beginning, maro?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:58.100
That's right.
It's the world's oldest book.

00:17:58.966 --> 00:18:02.196
It contains lore of old old days.

00:18:03.666 --> 00:18:05.166
You still don't get it?

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:09.130
You guys are the descendants
of the Seven Soldiers.

00:18:10.933 --> 00:18:12.133
We are?

00:18:12.766 --> 00:18:14.326
The Seven Soldiers...

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.770
Grankingdom declared war
against the world.

00:18:19.533 --> 00:18:26.173
It's important to stop them, but we need
to obtain new powers to do it.

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:31.130
Our goal is to get hold
of the Extra Seven

00:18:31.166 --> 00:18:34.166
and to obtain powers
to go against Nene.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:39.800
I am not going to force you.
I will honor your decision.

00:18:48.733 --> 00:18:50.533
What are you going to do, Shu?

00:18:56.166 --> 00:18:56.826
I will do it!

00:18:57.466 --> 00:19:00.226
We can't allow any more
sadness to spread.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:04.070
We can't have other people
get hurt, like Kluke.

00:19:05.733 --> 00:19:10.773
I might not have the right to say this yet,
but we can't leave Nene like this.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:16.070
I'm gonna get stronger
and defeat Nene!

00:19:17.833 --> 00:19:18.503
Jiro?

00:19:19.633 --> 00:19:20.873
Do you need to ask?

00:19:21.466 --> 00:19:22.126
Marumaro?

00:19:22.733 --> 00:19:26.273
I'm lost.
But I will fight for justice!

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:27.170
Bouquet?

00:19:27.633 --> 00:19:31.403
Of course I'm coming.
I will always be beside my fiancÃ©.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.070
Good.

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:35.670
But Kluke...

00:19:42.766 --> 00:19:44.996
Come on!

00:19:45.466 --> 00:19:47.166
Wake up, Kluke!

00:19:47.633 --> 00:19:49.873
It was because of you
that we're saved!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:53.770
We know what we have to do now!
So please!

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.530
Wake up!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.230
Please wake up!

00:19:58.633 --> 00:20:01.873
Kluke! Hey, Kluke!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.700
Kluke...

00:20:07.433 --> 00:20:08.933
This works the best.

00:20:20.866 --> 00:20:21.866
Shu?

00:20:27.933 --> 00:20:30.133
Wake up!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.600
Wake up, Kluke!
It's not time to be sleeping!

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:34.900
Kluke!

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.000
Kluke!

00:20:50.966 --> 00:20:53.626
Please...wake up.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.230
I'm sorry, Kluke.

00:21:05.566 --> 00:21:08.096
I was right there with you, yet.

00:21:08.866 --> 00:21:11.066
What's with...all the noise?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.500
Kluke...

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:20.970
Um...where am I?

00:21:21.466 --> 00:21:22.496
Kluke!

00:21:23.533 --> 00:21:24.203
What?

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.970
She woke up.

00:21:26.833 --> 00:21:29.203
Kluke! Kluke!

00:21:31.533 --> 00:21:33.173
What are you doing?!

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:40.070
Finally awake, huh?

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.370
Where...are we?

00:21:47.766 --> 00:21:50.396
Gosh, you made us worry.

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:52.300
What?

00:21:53.966 --> 00:21:55.426
Welcome back, Kluke.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.870
Th-Thanks.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.830
Now we are all together again.

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:22.900
Are you ready?

00:22:23.433 --> 00:22:24.103
Yeah!

00:22:24.966 --> 00:22:25.626
Let's go!

00:22:38.266 --> 00:22:40.166
You are coming too, maro?

00:22:40.433 --> 00:22:42.273
Of course I am!

00:24:20.966 --> 00:24:22.196
A board meeting is held

00:24:22.233 --> 00:24:25.133
to create a modern version of
the Book of the Beginning for kids.

00:24:25.166 --> 00:24:28.866
How about turning it into manga
by a famous manga artist?

00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:31.670
Then I will pose as
the swimsuit model for the cover.

00:24:31.700 --> 00:24:34.570
Is that a rare picture, maro?

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:36.270
It's not for you
so don't get too excited!

00:24:36.466 --> 00:24:38.926
Next on Blue Dragon:
"The Book of the Beginning."
